@startuml portfolio-service-class-diagram
title Level 3: Code - Class Diagram (portfolio-service) - FR-11\nOwner: Arwa Mohey Hamdy
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  BackgroundColor<<component>> #D5EFE0
  BorderColor<<component>> #2E8B57
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
hide empty members

legend right
  |<#D5EFE0>   | Class of a component |
  |<#FFFFFF>   | Interface / domain class |
  | Solid arrow, open head | Uses (required interface / class) |
  | Dotted arrow, hollow head | Implements (provided interface) |
  | Filled diamond | Composition |
  | Plain line | Association |
endlegend

interface IPortfolio <<provided>> {
  +addProject(studentId, data): Project
  +linkSkills(projectId, skillIds): void
  +attachDocument(projectId, doc): void
  +getPortfolio(studentId): List<Project>
}

class PortfolioService <<component>> {
  -skill: ISkill
  -repository: IProjectRepository
  -urlValidator: UrlValidator
  --
  +addProject(...) / linkSkills(...)
  +attachDocument(...) / getPortfolio(...)
}

IPortfolio <|.. PortfolioService
class UrlValidator <<component>> {
  +isValid(url): boolean
}
PortfolioService --> UrlValidator

interface ISkill <<required - Skill service>> {
  +addSkill(studentId, skill): Skill
  +updateLevel(skillId, level): void
  +getSkills(studentId): List<Skill>
  +getSkillGaps(studentId): List<SkillGap>
}

PortfolioService --> ISkill
interface IProjectRepository <<required - Database>> {
  +save(item: Project): void
  +findById(id): Project
  +findByOwner(ownerId): List<Project>
}

PortfolioService --> IProjectRepository
class Project {
  -projectId: String
  -title: String
  -description: String
  -technologies: List<String>
  -status: String
  -links: List<String>
  --
  +isCompleted(): boolean
}
class ProjectDocument {
  -name: String
  -fileRef: String
}
IProjectRepository --> Project
Project *-- "0..*" ProjectDocument
note bottom of PortfolioService
SOLID applied:
S - PortfolioService only coordinates; UrlValidator each do one job.
O - new behaviour is added by new implementations, not by editing PortfolioService.
L - PortfolioService can replace any other IPortfolio implementation.
I - IPortfolio has only the operations its clients use.
D - PortfolioService depends on interfaces (ISkill, IProjectRepository), not on concrete classes.
end note
@enduml
